<title>MOLDOVA: SOCCER-ITALY BEAT MOLDOVA 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY BEAT MOLDOVA 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy beat Moldova 3-1 (halftime</p>
<p>1-1) in their World Cup, European group two qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Moldova - Alexandru Curtianu (11th min)</p>
<p>Italy - Fabrizio Ravanelli (8th, 87th), Pierluigi Casiraghi</p>
<p>(68th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p>Group two standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> England     1   1   0   0   3   0    3</p>
<p> Italy	 1   1   0   0   3   1    3</p>
<p> Georgia     0   0   0   0   0   0    0</p>
<p> Poland	0   0   0   0   0   0    0</p>
<p> Moldova     2   0   0   2   1   6    0</p>
<p>Next matches: Oct 9 - Italy v Georgia, England v Poland</p>
</text>
